<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22463" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλωχίν</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span> or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλωχίς</span></b>  (cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			2.431
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			437
		</span></i>), ἡ, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖνος</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>projecting point</i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>end of the yoke-strap</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.274
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>barb</i> of an arrow, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				681
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.adloc., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.548
			</span></i>; <i>point</i> of a penknife, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.63
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Damoch.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριαίνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					36.111
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραίας</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				1.193
			</span></i>; of the moon's horns, ib.<i><span class="en">
				40.314
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Pythagorean
			name for <i>an angle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
			</span></i><i>*Deff.</i><i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>extremity</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυμάτη γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					184
				</span></i>
			; <i>inlet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλάττης γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agath.
					5.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>stigma</i> of saffron, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				11.261
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
